.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-ENDPOINT 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-endpoint \- Configure the QSM HTTPS endpoint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-endpoint [--show] [--listen ADDRESS] [--port PORT] [--public-url URL]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Use --show to inspect the saved configuration. Binding changes are validated and signalling is restarted with rollback on failure. Read the standalone guide before changing a remotely used endpoint.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
